,{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-05-25T20:36:56Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T19:24:57Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\ngodot 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nVoid Linux\n\n### Issue description\n\nVariables with @export will clear their previously set values, if the script extends a script that is a template. It seems to work fine, if the extended script is not a template.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a script in script_templates/ featuring a variable with @export.\n2. Create a node and add a new script to it. The node's script should extend the script template.\n3. In the node, set the value of the variable in the Inspector tab.\n4. Restart the editor.\n5. Previously set variable is now cleared.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[export_clear_on_script_template.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20432590/export_clear_on_script_template.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106804/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106804/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}